  "ingredients": [
    "1 large egg",
    "1 tablespoon white sugar",
    "2 tablespoons strongly brewed espresso",
    "0.25 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 (1 inch thick) slices day-old Italian bread",
    "3 tablespoons dry Marsala wine",
    "1 tablespoon white sugar",
    "0.5 cup mascarpone cheese",
    "1 tiny pinch salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Line a baking pan with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FqqAqQLrredSxlJRtW_b7IEsGJA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8458788-tiramisu-toast-VAT-4x3-ingredients-b2723a79a1794c9e8d9406cc1db01a04.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458788/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crack egg into a baking dish. Add white sugar, espresso, and vanilla extract. Whisk to combine. Place bread slices into the dish and toss in the mixture to saturate; let sit for 10 to 15 minutes to fully absorb.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WHDr5RiaXgUV3axKfWngdQZG8ac=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8458788-tiramisu-toast-VAT-4x3-step-01-558736d9150440a796ef2679ec694f85.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458788/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer bread slices to the prepared pan and drizzle any accumulated coffee mixture liquid over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U9BaWtDw3OK32VAmTBI3FLT4uCM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8458788-tiramisu-toast-VAT-4x3-step-02-5b331978ec2640ea89eb73afe0b22c2c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458788/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake toast in the center of the preheated oven until custard is cooked and bread bounces back slightly when touched, 20 to 25 minutes. Transfer slices to a wire rack to cool to room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DJghCgKyNEDCuhR6xbRYUnR-3Jg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8458788-tiramisu-toast-VAT-4x3-step-03-59a420edcb674f0b99d0658d1d2d0c1c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458788/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, pour wine into a saucepan. Add sugar and cook over medium heat until reduced to about 1 tablespoon. Remove from heat and let cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZF71orLpIMd7Jc-XPsRTSsKFMRQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8458788-tiramisu-toast-VAT-4x3-step-04-75c49b94b491443891f582fbe435cccd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458788/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place mascarpone cheese into a bowl and add cooled wine reduction and a very small pinch of salt. Stir with a spatula until combined. Chill before piping or spreading on cooled toast. Top with shaved chocolate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d4KNdigZ0m8jcG76qVE-6PmEp_Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8458788-tiramisu-toast-VAT-hero-4x3-b-a7de46b80ff14a45b96c4763922e3e3f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458788/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
